  "body": "This pulls out the only-editorial portions of https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/2673, and also does a bit more cleanup, including adding the explicit slot @annevk requested. I will rebase #2673 on top of this so that we can focus only on normative changes.\n\nNote that the parser <-> Document association is itself not super-rigorous, but I didn't want to shave that yak too, so we'll have to live with that for now :).\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5154/parsing.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 13, 2019, 11:02 PM UTC (0f588ac)\">/parsing.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5154/2e317cf...0f588ac/parsing.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 13, 2019, 11:02 PM UTC (0f588ac)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5154/scripting.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 13, 2019, 11:02 PM UTC (0f588ac)\">/scripting.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5154/2e317cf...0f588ac/scripting.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 13, 2019, 11:02 PM UTC (0f588ac)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5154/webappapis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 13, 2019, 11:02 PM UTC (0f588ac)\">/webappapis.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5154/2e317cf...0f588ac/webappapis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 13, 2019, 11:02 PM UTC (0f588ac)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5154/xhtml.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 13, 2019, 11:02 PM UTC (0f588ac)\">/xhtml.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5154/2e317cf...0f588ac/xhtml.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 13, 20